# Design system

- Use design tokens, never raw values:
  - Colors: `Theme.Colors.*` (e.g. `Theme.Colors.red`, `.background`, `.textPrimary`). Do NOT hardcode hex or `Color(red:green:blue:)` in views.
  - Fonts: `AppFont.*` (e.g. `AppFont.title`, `.button`, `.body`) — the Inter type scale. Do NOT use `.system(size:)` or `Font.custom(...)` directly in features.
  - Spacing/radii: `Theme.Spacing.*` / `Theme.Radius.*`.
- Reuse shared components in `Core/Components/` (`MarvelButton`, `MarvelTextField`,
  `PosterCard`, `StepIndicatorView`, `CodeEntryField`, `MarvelConfirmDialog`) instead
  of re-building buttons/fields/dialogs.
- Screens use `.screenBackground()` for the standard black background.
- Assets: reference images by their asset-catalog names (`poster_*`, `avatar_*`,
  `brand_*`); add new ones to `Assets.xcassets` rather than bundling loose files.
